id: synergistic-fusion
name: Synergistic Fusion
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
description: >
  Your Fused Characters are so synchronized that you are able to tap into even greater latent power dwelling deep within you.
text: >
  Synergistic Fusion: Your Fused Characters are so synchronized that you are able to tap into even greater latent power dwelling deep within you.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Your Fused Characters had 2+1(bT) or more Talents that were the same.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Attribute Modifiers (AG/FO/TE/MA) by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Power Level by 3 (see — Fusion Power Level). Recalculate your Fusion’s base Tier of Power, Life Points, Ki Points, and Capacity.

---

[passive]
# (2)
agility.mod += 1(T);
force.mod += 1(T);
tenacity.mod += 1(T);
magic.mod += 1(T);
# (3) Read where the Fusion Power Level is worked out (fusion.mjs fusionPowerLevel) - its base Tier of Power, Life, Ki and Capacity
# from it.
